From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:04:59 +0000
Subject: arm64: dts: allwinner: orangepi-zero2: Read the SPI NOR over two
 lines

WP# and HOLD# are tied to VCC (schematic v1.3), so read over two lines.

[aiyengar: mainline adds the property to the flash@0 node that
 sunxi/dt-for-7.5 already has; 7.3 has no &spi0 node in this file,
 so add one here]
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261118-zero2-spi-nor-dual-read-v1-1-bcdcbf785be0@gmail.com
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616-orangepi-zero2.dts
@@ -163,3 +163,9 @@ flash@0 {
 		vcc-supply = <&reg_aldo1>;
 	};
 };
+
+&spi0 {
+	flash@0 {
+		spi-rx-bus-width = <2>;
+	};
+};
-- 
Armbian

